      "id": 6937189908613,
      "title": "Scarlet Tower - Retro Edition (PRE-ORDER)",
      "handle": "scarlet-tower-retro-edition",
      "body_html": "<h1 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span>Hunt during the day, be hunted during the NIGHT! Scarlet Tower is a gothic horror casual game with roguelike and RPG elements!<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></strong></h1>\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"height: 95px; width: 100%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 20.4054%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Title</td>\n<td style=\"width: 75.5946%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Scarlet Tower<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 20.4054%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Version</td>\n<td style=\"width: 75.5946%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Retro Edition</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 20.4054%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Preorders Open</td>\n<td style=\"width: 75.5946%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">March 2024<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 20.4054%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Release Date</td>\n<td style=\"width: 75.5946%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">TBD<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 20.4054%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Stock Level</td>\n<td style=\"width: 75.5946%;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1-Month Open Preorder, then Limited Quantities.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/scarlet_tower_RETRO_splash.png?v=1711398355\" width=\"514\" height=\"296\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Retro Edition includes:</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></strong></span></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Nintendo Switch Physical Case and Game</b><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> w/ double sided insert, challenge card &amp; full color manual</span>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">SNES-Style Retro Box</b><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <br></span>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Jewel Case CD <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Official Soundtrack</strong></span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A <strong>BONUS ITEM</strong> to be announced shortly!<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img height=\"319\" width=\"556\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/Scarlet_Tower_title.jpg?v=1711318144\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Face down the evil of the night in Scarlet Tower!</strong> This auto-shooter features robust <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">RPG</strong> mechanics to let you play exactly the way you want to play, while pursuing that <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">PERFECT</strong> item build that will let you wipe out <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">100's of enemies</strong> a second! <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">7 different characters</strong> await you, all with different attacks, movement options, ultimate attacks and more, there is a character for everyone here in <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Scarlet Tower!</strong><img height=\"272\" width=\"563\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/HEROES.gif?v=1711318385\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Heroes with unique weapons, abilities, and talents<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Over 70 weapons<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Weapon fusion system<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Over 200 passive abilities for building your build<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img height=\"313\" width=\"556\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/scjhio.gif?v=1711318453\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Racial Abilities<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Pets<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Runes<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Bestiary<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Over 20 hours of content</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img height=\"396\" width=\"559\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/355be085362ae4b5b39eaa5d69f1fee69f6535b0.gif?v=1711318453\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Bosses with unique abilities<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Thousands of unlockables<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Long character progression<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Runs perfectly on Steam Deck</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img height=\"234\" width=\"561\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/rainT.gif?v=1711318444\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Supports Ultrawide<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Day and Night Cycle<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Endless Mode</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></ul>\n<p class=\"font_8\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sswnsU1-8FI?si=ltftaAuNzZKu2sxS\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">All orders are considered final and cannot be canceled without approval. If approved, canceled orders will be subject to any non-refundable charges<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">occurred</span> through the transaction process.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>",
