      "title": "Scarlet Tower - Standard Edition (PRE-ORDER)",
      "handle": "scarlet-tower-standard-edition",
      "body_html": "<h1 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span>Hunt during the day, be hunted during the NIGHT! Scarlet Tower is a gothic horror casual game with roguelike and RPG elements!<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></strong></h1>\n<table data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 95px; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20.4054%;\">Title</td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 75.5946%;\">Scarlet Tower<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20.4054%;\">Version</td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 75.5946%;\">Standard Edition</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20.4054%;\">Preorders Open</td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 75.5946%;\">March 2024<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20.4054%;\">Release Date</td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 75.5946%;\">TBD<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20.4054%;\">Stock Level</td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 75.5946%;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1-Month Open Preorder, then Limited Quantities.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img height=\"305\" width=\"530\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/scarlet_tower_stardard_splash.png?v=1711397379\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">All Standard Edition Releases by Premium Edition include:</strong></span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">All of our Numbered Standard Editions offer the same high quality items and goodies for consistency sake!</span></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Nintendo Switch Physical Case and Game</b></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Double-sided Insert</strong></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Full Color Manual</strong></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A </span><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Numbered<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span>Challenge<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span>Card</b><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> where you can earn a limited Challenge Patch!</span>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A hand-painted <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Full Color Glossy</strong><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Slipcase</strong> </span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">and a<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Preorder Bonus Dog Tag</strong>! (These are made on demand and only available during the preorder window)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img data-mce-fragment=\"1\" height=\"319\" width=\"556\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/Scarlet_Tower_title.jpg?v=1711318144\"></p>\n<p><strong>Face down the evil of the night in Scarlet Tower!</strong> This auto-shooter features robust <strong>RPG</strong> mechanics to let you play exactly the way you want to play, while pursuing that <strong>PERFECT</strong> item build that will let you wipe out <strong>100's of enemies</strong> a second! <strong>7 different characters</strong> await you, all with different attacks, movement options, ultimate attacks and more, there is a character for everyone here in <strong>Scarlet Tower!</strong><img height=\"272\" width=\"563\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/HEROES.gif?v=1711318385\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\n<li>Heroes with unique weapons, abilities, and talents<br>\n</li>\n<li>Over 70 weapons<br>\n</li>\n<li>Weapon fusion system<br>\n</li>\n<li>Over 200 passive abilities for building your build<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img data-mce-fragment=\"1\" height=\"313\" width=\"556\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/scjhio.gif?v=1711318453\"></p>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\n<li>Racial Abilities<br>\n</li>\n<li>Pets<br>\n</li>\n<li>Runes<br>\n</li>\n<li>Bestiary<br>\n</li>\n<li>Over 20 hours of content</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img height=\"396\" width=\"559\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/355be085362ae4b5b39eaa5d69f1fee69f6535b0.gif?v=1711318453\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\n<li>Bosses with unique abilities<br>\n</li>\n<li>Thousands of unlockables<br>\n</li>\n<li>Long character progression<br>\n</li>\n<li>Runs perfectly on Steam Deck</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img height=\"234\" width=\"561\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0380/1418/9701/files/rainT.gif?v=1711318444\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\">\n<li>Supports Ultrawide<br>\n</li>\n<li>Day and Night Cycle<br>\n</li>\n<li>Endless Mode</li>\n</ul>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"font_8\"> <br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sswnsU1-8FI?si=ltftaAuNzZKu2sxS\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\"></iframe><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">All orders are considered final and cannot be canceled without approval. If approved, canceled orders will be subject to any non-refundable charges<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">occurred</span> through the transaction process.</li>\n</ul>",
